  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "For every real delta with 0 < delta < 1/6, for the exact three-job restricted-assignment instance, nonincreasing-size interval order, half-open slot convention, and job-saturating Step-3 matching definition frozen in source.md, the slot graph has exactly eight valid job-to-slot matchings. Their induced makespan multiset, counted with matching multiplicity, is {(11/6-delta)^1, (4/3-delta)^2, 1^5}; hence the minimum makespan is 1 and the maximum is 11/6-delta. No assertion is made about endpoints, other fractional points, or arbitrary instances of the rounding algorithm.",
